  "descriptionHtml": "<div data-page-id=\"URf1dee3woE47ZxUjjicph6mnDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcngdKVEzjRZ9jTx3K06TaKHh\">The Aventon Pace 4 is the next-generation cruiser you've been waiting for. It combines smart bike technology, comfortable frame geometry, and enhanced touchpoints to maximize fun on every ride. Designed for those looking to get around town, go for a ride along the beach, or simply rediscover their local neighborhood on two wheels, the Pace is ready to cruise. Thanks to its 500W of motor power paired with torque sensor technology, Pace 4 is ready to elevate all of your weekend rides, while the 3 customizable levels of pedal assist allow you to fine tune the bikes behavior to match your riding style and preferences. With added security features like GPS<span><sup>†</sup></span> tracking, unusual activity detection, rear wheel lock, and much more, Pace 4 gives you peace of mind knowing your bike is always secure so you can focus solely on the fun ahead. Get ready to cruise, with the all new Pace 4.</div>\n</div><h2>Buying your Aventon from Quest Watersports</h2><ul><li>Every e-bike purchased through Quest Watersports includes a <strong>$160 assembly and tuning fee</strong>.</li><li>Colors and sizes we don't have in stock can be special ordered. Call 815.433.2200 or request info below.</li><li>Financing is available through Synchrony, subject to credit approval.</li></ul>",
